# ripgrep ignore rules for agents searching this repository (Hermes devops
# sandbox, editors). .gitignore already denies everything that is not
# allowlisted, but ripgrep still descended into some bind-mounted data
# folders; these are never useful to search and can be huge or unreadable.
*/data/
*/postgres/
*/database/
*/redis/
*/valkey/
*/config/
!grafana/provisioning/
!homepage/config/
immich/library/
immich/model-cache/
llama-cpp/models/*/
llama-cpp-classifier/models/*/
llama.cpp/
unsloth-studio/work/
nextcloud/html/
nextcloud/mcp-data/
gitlab/logs/
benchmark/reports/
firefly-iii/uploads/
firefly-iii/import-archive/
tandoor-recipes/mediafiles/
tandoor-recipes/staticfiles/
wger/media/
wger/static/
wger/celery-beat/
home-assistant/piper/
home-assistant/whisper/
pi-hole/etc-pihole/
silverbullet/space/
hermes/workspace/
hermes-sandboxes/keys/
*.gguf
*.safetensors
